{"4004240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Halmgaard MMORPG", "steam_appid": 4004240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the World of Halmgaard<br>A nostalgic yet fresh 2D MMORPG experience — built for adventurers seeking challenge, freedom, and community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Cross-Platform Gameplay</strong><br>Play seamlessly across mobile and other devices. Your journey follows you wherever you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leveling System</strong> – Grow stronger as you fight, explore, and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System</strong> – Train melee, accuracy, magic, and more. Customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells &amp; Classes</strong> – Choose from various classes and unleash a wide range of powerful spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchantment &amp; Blacksmithing</strong> – Upgrade your gear through a risk-based enhancement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Combat</strong> – Engage in high-stakes player-versus-player battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Hunts &amp; Solo Play</strong> – Join others or face the world alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Crafting</strong> – Unlock powerful magic by creating your own runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong> – Discover quests, secrets, and hidden dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Risk, High Reward</strong> – Take bold risks for legendary rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Bosses</strong> – Face epic bosses with your team for rare and powerful loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Housing</strong> – Own property, decorate your space, and showcase your rare equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Inspired by Classic 2D MMORPGs</strong><br>Built with love for the golden age of online RPGs — where every corner hides a story, and every decision matters.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the World of Halmgaard<br>A nostalgic yet fresh 2D MMORPG experience — built for adventurers seeking challenge, freedom, and community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Cross-Platform Gameplay</strong><br>Play seamlessly across mobile and other devices. Your journey follows you wherever you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leveling System</strong> – Grow stronger as you fight, explore, and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill System</strong> – Train melee, accuracy, magic, and more. Customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells &amp; Classes</strong> – Choose from various classes and unleash a wide range of powerful spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchantment &amp; Blacksmithing</strong> – Upgrade your gear through a risk-based enhancement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Combat</strong> – Engage in high-stakes player-versus-player battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Hunts &amp; Solo Play</strong> – Join others or face the world alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Crafting</strong> – Unlock powerful magic by creating your own runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open World Exploration</strong> – Discover quests, secrets, and hidden dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Risk, High Reward</strong> – Take bold risks for legendary rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Bosses</strong> – Face epic bosses with your team for rare and powerful loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Housing</strong> – Own property, decorate your space, and showcase your rare equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Inspired by Classic 2D MMORPGs</strong><br>Built with love for the golden age of online RPGs — where every corner hides a story, and every decision matters.</p>", "short_description": "Step into Halmgaard — a nostalgic yet fresh 2D MMORPG where freedom, challenge, and community meet. Explore an open world, master magic and skills, forge your destiny, and take risks for legendary rewards.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004240/c19a05c4c6cbdb20a00b8a36c63617f18ccfc493/header.jpg?t=1764366418", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004240/f941cfbcc8f033285b928f0654252e02043d58ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764366418", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004240/f941cfbcc8f033285b928f0654252e02043d58ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764366418", "website": "https://halmgaard.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> OS: Windows 7 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Processor: Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "ext_user_ac